Z||000000||William Federle||01-19-2000||11:37 AM||||Can anyone tell me where the tach filter is located on a 1984 Fiero 4 cylinder engine?||||reg||1
Z||000001||DRH||01-19-2000||11:52 AM||||If memory serves... it is taped up in the wiring harness near the ignition coil where the harness runs across the transmission end of the head. It is a cylinder about 1/2" dia and about 2" long with a wire going into each end.<P>David.||||reg||1
